  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1741\">\n<li data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1539\">\n<p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1346\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1344\">CD31 Positive:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1539\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1453\">\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1453\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Confirms <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1392\">endothelial origin of lesion</strong> (seen in <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1449\">hemangiomas, angiosarcoma, Kaposi&rsquo;s sarcoma</strong>).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1539\">\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1539\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Also used to assess <strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1522\">tumor angiogenesis (microvessel density)</strong> in solid tumors.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1625\">\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1563\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1561\">CD31 Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1625\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1625\">\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1625\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Excludes vascular origin (lesion likely non-endothelial).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1741\">\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1741\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Must be interpreted <strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1740\">with H&amp;E morphology, other IHC markers (e.g., CD34, Factor VIII), and clinical findings</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
